msgid "Whether the user will be able to authenticate using a password or not. If disabled, they may still be able to authenticate using other backends, such as Single Sign-On or LDAP."
msgstr "Foydalanuvchi parol bilan tizimga kira oladimi yoki yo'q."

msgid "Enter the same password as before, for verification."
msgstr "Tekshirish uchun parolni qaytadan kiriting."

msgid "The two password fields didn’t match."
msgstr "Parollar mos kelmadi."

msgid "Raw passwords are not stored, so there is no way to see the user’s password."
msgstr "Parollar ochiq holda saqlanmaydi, shuning uchun foydalanuvchi parolini ko'rib bo'lmaydi."

msgid "Enable password-based authentication for this user by setting a password."
msgstr "Parol o'rnatib, bu foydalanuvchiga parol bilan kirishga ruxsat bering."

msgid "Please enter a correct %(username)s and password. Note that both fields may be case-sensitive."
msgstr "To'g'ri %(username)s va parolni kiriting."

