msgid "Your old password was entered incorrectly. Please enter it again."
msgstr "Eski parol noto'g'ri kiritildi. Qaytadan kiriting."

msgid "Designates that this user has all permissions without explicitly assigning them."
msgstr "Bu foydalanuvchi barcha ruxsatlarga ega bo'ladi."

msgid "The groups this user belongs to. A user will get all permissions granted to each of their groups."
msgstr "Foydalanuvchi a'zo bo'lgan guruhlar. Har bir guruhning ruxsatlari unga ham beriladi."

msgid "Designates whether the user can log into this admin site."
msgstr "Foydalanuvchi admin panelga kira oladimi."

msgid "Designates whether this user should be treated as active. Unselect this instead of deleting accounts."
msgstr "Foydalanuvchi faolmi. Akkauntni o'chirish o'rniga shu belgini olib tashlang."

